00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.410
Trend number one.

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.243
- Yeah, I'm fired up.

00:00:56.243 --> 00:01:00.200
Number one is I actually
think that in 2020 and beyond

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:05.200
