Trend number three is

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.070
I would say Instagram overall,
still a mega platform.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:08.000
We love YouTube, of course.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.220
Things are happening on Tik Tok.

