00:17:23.596 --> 00:17:24.950
What does that mean?

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.080
It means that, wow, for a while there,

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.270
like almost a decade ago now,
on Facebook, it was like,

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.970
wow, if I've got 1,000 likes

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:35.930
and I post a photo,
850 people will see it.

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.158
Like, those days are long gone, right?

00:17:37.158 --> 00:17:39.930
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:40.820
- It wasn't pay to play.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.410
It was like, wow, I can grow my business,

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.760
