a speaker, grow my ministry.

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:49.724
I could just grow by taking
action on these platforms.

00:17:49.724 --> 00:17:52.020
But then it shifted to where it was like

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.030
basically we want you to boost posts,

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.840
we want you to do light campaigns,

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.420
we want you to do Facebook ads.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:17:59.050
And that has been true there.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.140
What I'm seeing and what we're seeing

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:03.150
across all platforms now is that

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:05.140
