00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.601
Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn,
it's gonna happen everywhere.

00:18:20.601 --> 00:18:23.200
And so, they've been
growing their companies,

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.270
