00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.780
And as the feed, there's
only that one feed.

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:30.690
Like, it can only fit so much content.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.610
And so, as more people
get on the platform,

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:34.570
