this information away

00:18:40.400 --> 00:18:43.430
because it's like that just
more people posting in the feed.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:45.670
But what our passion is, is like, again,

00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:47.000
these are the things that are working now

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:48.880
and we wanna give away
those best practices.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:51.310
So even this one is then saying, okay,

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.580
set your business up in such a way

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:56.810
that you can profit from advertising,

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.830
meaning you're selling something online.

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.880
Then in that way, you're gonna
get brand lift, brand reach,

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:05.050
brand awareness because if
you're paying for more reach,

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:06.410
