00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.240
But I am saying that, for example,

00:19:12.240 --> 00:19:15.490
when we do YouTube advertising
or Facebook advertising,

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:18.430
it leads directly to
the sale of something,

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:20.560
